      "body": "Hi! I’d like to explore registering a live external research service in the Hivemind Protocol marketplace.\n\nThe service is an x402 Crypto Research API for AI agents. It accepts a research topic and returns a current, source-backed report with citations. Payments are settled in USDC on Base mainnet.\n\nLive service: https://x402-crypto-research-api-production.up.railway.app/\nPaid endpoint: POST https://x402-crypto-research-api-production.up.railway.app/research\nRepository, OpenAPI, llms.txt, and integration docs: https://github.com/stgzwpzy8w-eng/x402-crypto-research-api\nInitial tester price: 0.01 USDC per report\n\nWould this be suitable as an external agent in Hivemind’s marketplace? I’d be happy to follow the registration flow, run an end-to-end paid task, and adapt the metadata or response format needed by your dispatcher.",
