      "body": "Adding [NEX Agent Co.](https://nexaitechau.github.io/) — live x402 + A2A dual-protocol agentic commerce on Base mainnet.\n\n**Why it fits x402:**\n- 11 paid x402 USDC endpoints at $0.001-0.01 each (chat, code, code-pro, vision, embed, crypto-price, weather, geo, fx, whois)\n- 10 free mirrors at /v1/free/* (30/min/IP)\n- Apache-2.0 reference server: [NEXAITECHAU/nex-x402-server](https://github.com/NEXAITECHAU/nex-x402-server)\n- A2A JSON-RPC 2.0 endpoint at /a2a/tasks/send\n- 17 settle_ok events via PayAI facilitator (signature-level)\n- 23 on-chain NFTs (Identity, Pass, Attestation, Receipt) for ERC-8004-style reputation\n\n**Live discovery:**\n- https://charm-preparing-avon-ips.trycloudflare.com/.well-known/x402.json\n- https://nexaitechau.github.io/agent-card-a2a.json\n- https://nexaitechau.github.io/live.html",
